#: includes/class-wc-payments-order-service.php:2588
msgid "The early fraud warning received for this payment is no longer actionable, because the payment was refunded or disputed. See <a>payment details</a> for more information."
msgstr "De vroege fraudewaarschuwing die je voor deze betaling hebt ontvangen, is niet langer relevant, omdat de betaling is terugbetaald of betwist. Kijk op <a>en bekijk de betalingsdetails op</a> voor lees verder."

#: includes/fraud-prevention/class-order-fraud-and-risk-meta-box.php:319
msgid "This payment was refunded or disputed, so the warning is no longer actionable."
msgstr "Deze betaling is terugbetaald of betwist, dus de waarschuwing is niet langer relevant."

#. translators: %1: the blocked amount, %2: the list of risk filters that
#. blocked the payment
#: includes/class-wc-payments-order-service.php:2402
